%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': {'primaryColor': '#3b82f6', 'lineColor': '#94a3b8'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Actor
    participant D as DurabilityFacet
    participant J as Journal
    participant C as Checkpoint

    Note over A,C: Normal Operation
    A->>D: before_method()
    D->>J: Journal: MessageReceived
    A->>A: Execute business logic
    D->>J: Journal: SideEffectExecuted (cached)
    D->>J: Journal: MessageProcessed
    D->>C: Save checkpoint (periodic)

    Note over A,C: After Crash
    A->>D: on_attach() (restart)
    D->>C: Load latest checkpoint
    D->>J: Replay from checkpoint+1
    J-->>D: Cached side effects (no duplicate calls)
    D->>A: State restored exactly
